  m_text: "                              Menu/UI\nConfirm/Select:                                             
    A\nCancel/Back                                                  B\nPause:                                                     
    Start\n\n                               Fishing\n1. Move the bobber using the
    right stick.\n2. Cast/retrieve your fishing line by pressing the A button.\n\n                              
    Rhythm\n1. Flick the left stick or press the D-pad in the direction of incoming
    notes.\n2. Rotate the right stick in a circular motion to reel the fish at the
    end.\n"
