  m_text: "                              Menu/UI\nConfirm/Select:                     
    Down D-Pad / B\nCancel/Back                            Right D-Pad / A\nPause:                                                      
    - / +\n\n                              Fishing\n1. Move the bobber using the
    joystick.\n2. Cast the rod using a forward throwing motion.\n3. Hook a fish using
    a quick backward motion.\n\n                             Rhythm\n1. Flick or
    hold the joycon in the direction of incoming notes.\n2. Rotate the joystick in
    a circular motion to reel the fish at the end.\n"
